### Create a new account
POST http://localhost:8080/api/create
Content-Type: application/json

< ./create-account.json

### Fetch account details by mobile number
GET http://localhost:8080/api/fetch?mobileNumber=10433078871

### Update account details (put the real accountNumber from the fetch response in update-account.json)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/update
Content-Type: application/json

< ./update-account.json

### Delete account by mobile number
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/delete?mobileNumber=9876543210
